{"uid":"28339b96a77ed584","name":"Cross-Domain Misconfiguration","fullName":"ZAP API Scan - Cross-Domain Misconfiguration","historyId":"zap-cross-domain-misconfiguration","time":{"start":1774642501548,"stop":1774642501548,"duration":0},"description":"**Risk:** Medium\n**Confidence:** 2\n**Instances:** 4\n\n**Description:**\nWeb browser data loading may be possible, due to a Cross Origin Resource Sharing (CORS) misconfiguration on the web server.\n\n**Solution:**\nEnsure that sensitive data is not available in an unauthenticated manner (using IP address white-listing, for instance).Configure the \"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\" HTTP header to a more restrictive set of domains, or remove all CORS headers entirely, to allow the web browser to enforce the Same Origin Policy (SOP) in a more restrictive manner.","descriptionHtml":"<p><strong>Risk:</strong> Medium<br />\n<strong>Confidence:</strong> 2<br />\n<strong>Instances:</strong> 4</p>\n<p><strong>Description:</strong><br />\nWeb browser data loading may be possible, due to a Cross Origin Resource Sharing (CORS) misconfiguration on the web server.</p>\n<p><strong>Solution:</strong><br />\nEnsure that sensitive data is not available in an unauthenticated manner (using IP address white-listing, for instance).Configure the &quot;Access-Control-Allow-Origin&quot; HTTP header to a more restrictive set of domains, or remove all CORS headers entirely, to allow the web browser to enforce the Same Origin Policy (SOP) in a more restrictive manner.</p>\n","status":"broken","statusMessage":"Medium risk alert: Cross-Domain Misconfiguration","statusTrace":"4 instance(s) found. See ZAP HTML report for full details.","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[],"afterStages":[],"labels":[{"name":"suite","value":"Security - ZAP API Scan"},{"name":"feature","value":"OWASP ZAP"},{"name":"story","value":"Medium"},{"name":"severity","value":"normal"},{"n